
variable totLength equal 10

variable seed equal 1
units si
boundary p p p

atom_style molecular

region main block -100 100 -100 100 -100 100

create_box 21 main bond/types 20 angle/types 19 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/angle/per/atom 3 extra/special/per/atom 6
Created orthogonal box = (-100 -100 -100) to (100 100 100)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid

molecule raw_WLC_21_Atoms Structures/Raw/raw_WLC_21.txt
Read molecule template raw_WLC_21_Atoms:
# Molecule File for Worm-Like Chain with 21 atoms
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  21 atoms with max type 21
  20 bonds with max type 20
  19 angles with max type 19
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
bond_style harmonic
bond_style zero nocoeff
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style none

create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol raw_WLC_21_Atoms ${seed} rotate 0 0 0 1
create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol raw_WLC_21_Atoms 1 rotate 0 0 0 1
Created 21 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (-100 -100 -100) to (100 100 100)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

read_data Structures/Coeffs/coeffs_WLC_21.data add merge
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-100 -100 -100) to (100 100 100)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
WARNING: Bond style harmonic in data file differs from currently defined bond style zero (../read_data.cpp:809)
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     3 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     6 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
    18 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
    13 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.025 seconds
bond_coeff * 0 1
# angle_coeff * 0 180

group internals type 2:20
19 atoms in group internals
group endpoints subtract all internals
2 atoms in group endpoints


compute bondID all property/local btype batom1 batom2
compute angleID all property/local atype aatom1 aatom2 aatom3

variable k_restrain equal 200

fix restraint all arclengthrestraint raw_WLC_21_Atoms ${k_restrain} ${totLength}
fix restraint all arclengthrestraint raw_WLC_21_Atoms 200 ${totLength}
fix restraint all arclengthrestraint raw_WLC_21_Atoms 200 10
# print "fix arclengthrestraint has been imposed on system"
 fix_modify restraint energy yes


comm_modify cutoff 100

velocity all set 0 0 0
thermo_style custom step pe ke fnorm epair epair ebond eangle edihed etotal

compute forces all property/atom fx fy fz
compute sumForces all reduce sum c_forces[1] c_forces[2] c_forces[3]
variable totForce vector c_sumForces

run 0
WARNING: No fixes with time integration, atoms won't move (../verlet.cpp:60)
